*Heading
One-element Chester-Anand u-p-mu Quad8 smoke test
**
** Purpose:
** - isolate the generated mixed Quad8 UEL from the bending/contact deck;
** - keep u fixed, prescribe mu on DOF 12, and solve only corner pressure DOFs;
** - avoid Abaqus temperature initial conditions for gel mu because DOF 11 is p.
